begin="00:43.730" end="00:44.301">say </span><span begin="00:44.301" end="00:44.589">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.317" end="00:50.269"><span begin="00:45.317" end="00:45.749">Give </span><span begin="00:45.749" end="00:46.213">me </span><span begin="00:46.213" end="00:46.693">tough </span><span begin="00:46.693" end="00:50.269">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.749" end="00:55.365"><span begin="00:50.749" end="00:51.285">Leave </span><span begin="00:51.285" end="00:51.733">me </span><span begin="00:51.733" end="00:52.118">with </span><span begin="00:52.118" end="00:53.044">nothin' </span><span begin="00:53.252" end="00:53.492">when </span><span begin="00:53.492" end="00:53.820">I </span><span begin="00:54.045" end="00:54.341">come </span><span begin="00:54.526" end="00:55.365">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.269" end="01:01.332"><span begin="00:56.269" end="00:56.742">My </span><span begin="00:56.742" end="00:57.244">kind </span><span begin="00:57.244" end="00:57.653">of </span><span begin="00:57.653" end="01:01.332">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.764" end="01:06.349"><span begin="01:01.764" end="01:02.134">Force </span><span begin="01:02.333" end="01:02.692">me </span><span begin="01:02.692" end="01:03.084">and </span><span begin="01:03.084" end="01:03.461">choke </span><span begin="01:03.653" end="01:03.997">me </span><span begin="01:04.237" end="01:04.477">'til </span><span begin="01:04.477" end="01:04.837">I </span><span begin="01:05.077" end="01:05.389">pass </span><span begin="01:05.573" end="01:06.349">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.708" end="01:10.041"><span begin="01:07.708" end="01:07.901">We </span><span begin="01:07.901" end="01:07.952">don't </span><span begin="01:07.952" end="01:08.209">gotta </span><span begin="01:08.209" end="01:08.504">be </span><span begin="01:08.504" end="01:08.625">in </span><span begin="01:08.625" end="01:09.064">love </span><span begin="01:09.064" end="01:10.